Cell["\<\
Implementation of the model for COVID-19 pandemic using Planck\
\[CloseCurlyQuote]s probability distribution presented by Jos\[EAcute] \
Enrique Amaro and Jos\[EAcute] Nicol\[AAcute]s Orce | Pablo Cordon Blanco
